NOTE ON DATA-DERIVED ARTIFACTS: The above MIT license covers this
repository's original source code only. It does NOT cover the trained model
weights (`src/backend/best_model.pt`), the extracted feature file
(`data/KSL77_joint_stream_47pt.pkl`), or the example videos under
`src/frontend/public/videos/`. Those are all derived from the KSL-77 dataset
(Yang et al., "The Korean Sign Language Dataset for Action Recognition,"
MMSys/MMM 2020), which is licensed CC BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial, attribution
required). See `data/DATA_README.md` and `ATTRIBUTION.md` for details before
reusing those files.
